  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Sind die Grenzen okay?** · belastet: **facade (Container-Limit 700 MB, -Xmx2500m)** · starten: Laststeuerung `:8070` oder `python3 lasttest/mes_last.py --host <vm> szenario S09`\n\n**Worauf es ankommt:** Container-Speicher am Limit, Swap, dann Exit 137 und Neustart – kein OutOfMemoryError.\n\n**Voraussetzung:** Facade muss laufen: ./start.sh kunde --facade"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Container: belegt/Limit",
      "description": "cAdvisor – die Sicht, die das Limit kennt",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": null,
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.85,
                "color": "orange"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.95,
                "color": "red"
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(container_memory_working_set_bytes{rolle=\"facade\"}) / max(container_spec_memory_limit_bytes{rolle=\"facade\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
